{
    "title": "Footej Camera - PRO HD Camera",
    "description": "<h1>Take your mobile photography to the next level!</h1>\r\n\r\nThe sequel to Footej Camera \u2013 one of the best camera apps with 10,000,000+ downloads!\r\n\r\n<b>PRO Camera in your pocket!</b>\r\nA brand new, fascinating, user-friendly, and robust professional camera app is here, ready to capture, orchestrate and give a new life to your best moments!\r\n\r\n<b>Capture your favorite moments</b>\r\nImprove the quality of your pictures with the best camera app! Footej is a unique photo and video camera app which utilizes Android's camera 2 API! The professional-level camera app is easy to use, captures images, and makes a masterpiece.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 <b>Professional Camera Options inside the App!</b> \u2b50\r\nExperience a whole new level of mobile photography! Ful DSLR Camera, Manual Camera, Manual ISO, Shutter Speed Control, and many more professional options!\r\n\r\n<h2>Turn your photo into a professional HD Camera!</h2>\r\n\r\n<b>Footej Professional HD Camera Features:</b>\r\n-- Simple and bloat-free user interface\r\n-- Amazing Photo and Video quality\r\n-- Utilizes Android's camera 2 API (on devices that support the API)\r\n-- focus and exposure from different areas\r\n-- Integrated Gallery and Slider\r\n-- Burst mode - Fantastic Burst mode camera feature\r\n-- Animated GIFs\r\n-- Video slow motion camera recording \r\n-- Manual Camera, DSLR, Manual ISO, Focus, Shutter Speed control - Professional options\r\n-- RAW format\r\n-- Long exposure\r\n-- Perfect Lens Buddy\r\n-- Snapshot during video recording\r\n-- Selfie Light - best camera app for selfies\r\n-- Panorama camera mode\r\n-- Timelapse\r\n-- HDR+ (Pixel 2 devices)\r\n-- High frame rate recording\r\n\r\n<h2>Beautiful Smartphone Photography with Footej 2 - Professional HD Camera app!</h2>\r\n\r\n<b>Discover Footej Professional Camera Premium Package:</b>\r\n\u2b50 Burst Interval below 500ms\r\n\u2b50 More than 20 maximum shots in burst\r\n\u2b50 Better JPEG Quality\r\n\u2b50 Antibanding in 50Hz (Europe) and 60Hz (Asia)\r\n\u2b50 Video max duration over 2 minutes\r\n\u2b50 Photo histogram\r\n\u2b50 High-resolution Animated GIFs\r\n\u2b50 Timelapse interval over 10 seconds\r\n\u2b50 Video Stabilization\r\n\u2b50 Ful DSLR Camera\r\n\u2b50 Control Video Audio Source\r\n\r\n<b>Manual Camera Controls</b>\r\nUnleash the full potential of your device at a PRO level! Adjust the ISO, focus, exposure, shutter speed & more. Great camera with unique features.\r\n\r\n<b>Capture PRO-level photos</b>\r\nCreate a masterpiece with a best camera app. Capture your favorite moments with a professional HD camera!\r\n\r\nPRO Camera App for mobile recording. Use your device's camera to its full potential with a great camera app - Footej Camera 2! DSLR Camera, your perfect lens buddy!\r\n\r\nDiscover why Footej is considered to be a fantastic lens buddy and the best camera app! \u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50",
