 Antibanding in 50Hz (Europe) and 60Hz (Asia)<br>\u2b50 Video max duration over 2 minutes<br>\u2b50 Photo histogram<br>\u2b50 High-resolution Animated GIFs<br>\u2b50 Timelapse interval over 10 seconds<br>\u2b50 Video Stabilization<br>\u2b50 Ful DSLR Camera<br>\u2b50 Control Video Audio Source<br><br><b>Manual Camera Controls</b><br>Unleash the full potential of your device at a PRO level! Adjust the ISO, focus, exposure, shutter speed &amp; more. Great camera with unique features.<br><br><b>Capture PRO-level photos</b><br>Create a masterpiece with a best camera app. Capture your favorite moments with a professional HD camera!<br><br>PRO Camera App for mobile recording. Use your device&#39;s camera to its full potential with a great camera app - Footej Camera 2! DSLR Camera, your perfect lens buddy!<br><br>Discover why Footej is considered to be a fantastic lens buddy and the best camera app! \u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50",
